Mode: MATCHING
Generate questions where the user matches SHORT WORDS or PHRASES (not full sentences).

Each answer is a correct pair of two related items separated by " - " (space-hyphen-space).
The answer array contains ONLY correct pairs.

What to match:
- Word and its definition: "procrastinate - to delay unnecessarily"
- Word and its synonym: "happy - joyful"
- Word and its antonym: "hot - cold"
- Verb and its object: "read - book"

Example:
{
  "questions": [
    {
      "question": "Match the English word with its antonyms:",
      "answers": [
        {"answer": "hot - cold"},
        {"answer": "dry - wet"},
        {"answer": "rich - poor"}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
